dialog_lines = Array[String](["GLORP|Bleep... a human! With HANDS!", "YOU|Just passing through on my way to Ataraxia, honestly.", "GLORP|Not without a heat shield, you're not. The route runs through Cinderon-3, and Cinderon-3 hugs its sun. No shield means you arrive as a brief, beautiful streak.", "YOU|Let me guess. You have one, and there's a catch.", "GLORP|We pay in heat shields! Currency is a scam invented by robots. My hatchlings are STARVING and they refuse to feed them — 'unpredictable trajectories', they say.", "YOU|How hard can feeding babies be?", "GLORP|They are upside down and the food is falling. Catch it. Your shift starts NOW."])
